    "created_at": "2023-06-21T17:04:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-21T17:04:10Z",
    "body": "I tried adding this assert in chromium, but it got hit in [popover-invoker-reset.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/semantics/popovers/popover-invoker-reset.html).\r\n\r\nIn popover-invoker-reset, showPopover sets an invoker but then aborts showing the popover because the beforetoggle event handler prevents default, which then leaves us in the state where the popover has an invoker set but is closed. By calling showPopover again, the assert will be hit.\r\n\r\nIf we still want this assert then we need some way of clearing out the invoker at every exit point in showPopover or something.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1601241132/reactions",
