    "updated_at": "2023-06-21T18:26:50Z",
    "body": "> Should the invoker be asserted and manipulated after the \"check popover validity\" step?\r\n\r\nI think that wherever we put the assert doesn't matter. As long as it's possible to have the popover's invoker set to something while the popover is closed, I believe it will be possible to hit the assert",
